    glasses are on the floor to the right\",\"parentUIDs\":[0],\"SpeechUID\":-1},{\"Connections\":[],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-105.200012,\"yPos\":98},\"ID\":12,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"*Say
    nothing, let him figure it out*\",\"parentUIDs\":[0],\"SpeechUID\":-1},{\"Connections\":[],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-108.200012,\"yPos\":198},\"ID\":13,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Where
    are you? What is this place?\",\"parentUIDs\":[0],\"SpeechUID\":-1}],\"Parameters\":[],\"SpeechNodes\":[{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":5},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":6},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":12},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":13}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":true,\"xPos\":137.299988,\"yPos\":22},\"ID\":0,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"\u201CGod
    damn\u2026 My head.\u201D He puts his fingers to his temples before looking up
    from the ground. \u201CI can\u2019t see anything.\u201D\",\"parentUIDs\":[],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Harold
    Auden\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":-10.7000122,\"yPos\":280.000183},\"ID\":7,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Harold
    feels around on the floor. After a couple of minutes, he finds his glasses and
    wipes them on his shirt before putting them on. \",\"parentUIDs\":[6],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Harold
    Auden \",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":325.3,\"yPos\":239.0001},\"ID\":8,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"The
    lights are dim before bursting like white flame into the room. Dr. Auden groans
    in pain and sits there covering his eyes until he can feel the sting go away.\",\"parentUIDs\":[5],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Harold
    Auden\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0}]}"
